WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.209 --> 00:00:05.070
Hey youtubers it’s charlie, since there’s
no new Agents of SHIELD this week because

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:06.820
of the olympics I wanted to do a fun bonus
video.

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:09.280
The real mystery to talk about right now is
the identity of the clairvoyant.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.050
There have been a lot of really awesome theories
but I wanted to float this one to you just

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:13.050
for fun.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:16.219
It’s all a giant fake out, the real clairvoyant
is Loki.

00:00:16.219 --> 00:00:19.810
I’ve got a few other good theories about
who it is that invoke Winter Soldier, Age

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:21.460
of Ultron and the rest of the movies.

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.949
But let’s play with this before we talk
about those things.

00:00:23.949 --> 00:00:27.089
Here’s 5 big reasons it’s Loki

00:00:27.089 --> 00:00:30.570
Number 5 - Tom Hiddleston really wants to
participate in Agents of SHIELD.

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:35.469
When Joss whedon first announced the show,
Tom Hiddleston said he’d love to play a

00:00:35.469 --> 00:00:36.469
role.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:41.440
But, like all great actors, he too busy for
an extended run on a tv show.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:45.170
Plus there’s the added fact that he’d
totally steal any scene he was in making things

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.460
really confusing for the writers and the audience.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.290
But that doesn’t mean he couldn’t do a
very brief cameo in a kind of classic villain

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:53.839
reveal during the finale.

00:00:53.839 --> 00:00:57.530
It would be a really strong way to end the
series and capture more avengers fans for

00:00:57.530 --> 00:00:58.530
season 2.

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:04.350
Number 4 - Since the events of Thor The Dark
world Loki has been ruling asgard disguised

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:05.350
as Odin.

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:09.549
Asgargians have great toys, but the all-father
has a special observatory that helps him see

00:01:09.549 --> 00:01:11.409
things in the way Heimdall does.

00:01:11.409 --> 00:01:13.330
This would give him the appearance of clairvoyance.

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:17.990
But even if he didn’t have special toys,
regular asgardian technology would be enough

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:20.600
for him to peep on everyone if he chose to.

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:23.970
Number 3 - He does have a small axe to grind
with Coulson.

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:27.631
Remember just before he died in avengers,
Coulson really shook his confidence for a

00:01:27.631 --> 00:01:30.130
minute and then shot him with the destroyer
gun.

00:01:30.130 --> 00:01:32.299
They never did explain how that worked.

00:01:32.299 --> 00:01:36.170
Loki probably wouldn’t just be planning
mass chaos just to take a swipe at coulson,

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:37.210
but he is the god of mischief.

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:39.689
So he might just be killing two birds with
one stone.

00:01:39.689 --> 00:01:44.549
Number 2 - It’s a way to keep Tom Hiddleston
involved in the franchise even though he’s

00:01:44.549 --> 00:01:48.520
not going to be in any movies until phase
3.

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:52.570
Everyone wants a loki movie, but Marvel has
made no plans to make one.

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:56.360
So how do they keep the fandom happy and save
themselves 200 Million Dollars?

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:59.450
By just including him in their tv show.

00:01:59.450 --> 00:02:03.399
Side note, Tom Hiddleston is also kind of
Marvel’s international ambassador for public

00:02:03.399 --> 00:02:04.399
events.

00:02:04.399 --> 00:02:08.280
Something which he loves doing and we all
love watching him do.

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:12.833
and my number 1 reason why it could be Loki
- Asgard has been a huge part of the story

00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:13.833
this season.

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:18.080
First you have the rage spear from last year,
now Lady Sif is getting her own episode.

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:20.600
Each time they keep escalating things.

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:24.390
The next step up the superhero ladder would
be someone major from the movies.

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:28.160
And Chris Hemsworth is shooting avengers age
of ultron in england starting this week.

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.290
So he’s definitely not going to be on the
show.

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:41.750
Which leaves Loki.

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:44.380
All that being said here are a couple of other
alternatives that make sense given it’s

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:46.980
someone who will tie into Captain America
Winter Soldier and Age of Ultron.

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:52.460
The best real theory is Armin Zola of Hydra
from Captain America.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:57.260
The character has been the big villain featured
in the captain america comic books last year.

00:02:57.260 --> 00:03:00.680
He teased that he’d be coming back in winter
soldier as MODOK.

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:04.210
Marvel’s big comic book stories tend to
precede the films by about a year or two.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:06.740
So the timing lines up.

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:10.470
The other theory is The Leader.

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:11.470
Samuel Sterns.

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:15.270
In the prequel comics he was being kept in
the same facility the tesseract experiments

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:16.270
were being done.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:20.011
He’s been a relatively minor character and
Tim Blake Nelson, the actor who played him

00:03:20.011 --> 00:03:24.430
in Incredible Hulk would be a lot easier to
get than say Tom Hiddleston.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:27.870
He’s so smart that it could be construed
as clairvoyance.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:29.940
The other theory is that it’s the real Mandarin.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:31.830
But I think this theory is less likely.

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:39.000
If you consider that skye is half chinese,
and I’m expecting her status as a 0-8-4

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:44.440
to tie in with the clairvoyant, I’m thinking
the mandarin is her real father.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:48.470
That being said the mandarin being revealed
on a tv show and not a big budget movie is

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:52.850
really unlikely, so I think MODOK or The Leader
are better bets.

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:54.130
Crossing my fingers for Loki though.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.790
Wouldn’t it be bad ass if Loki was Skye’s
real father.

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:56.840
As if she came from the SKye.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:59.020
I feel like the writers are just teasing us
with word play.

